l in November to December in 37 of 75 years since 1951, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle saw June to July at 188% of normal and January to February at 34%. Grid 27448 had its driest year in 1989 at 54% of normal. A preliminary estimate puts August to September 2026 at 121.8 on that grid, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
